  <RG_AspenForest.label>白杨林</RG_AspenForest.label>
  <!-- EN: Forests of genetically modified aspen trees, keeping their colourful leaves nearly all year. Despite the harsh winters and colder summers, aspen forests sustain a diverse population of small and large animals. -->
  <RG_AspenForest.description>各种各样的基因工程杨树共同组成了这片色彩鲜活的森林。虽然这里冬季严寒，夏季清冷，但仍有许多规模各异的动物群落栖息于此。</RG_AspenForest.description>
  
